# Replace these placeholder channel names with records from your IOC.
$BEEPSEVERITY MAJOR
GROUP NULL Example
$ALIAS Example facility
$GUIDANCE
This example contains two placeholder PV names.
Open it in the editor to replace them with records from your IOC.
$END
GROUP Example Vacuum
CHANNEL Vacuum example:pressure -----
$ALIAS Vacuum pressure
CHANNEL Vacuum example:pump -----
$ALIAS Pump status
